1332
00:59:12,460 --> 00:59:13,613
but that's what I think.

1333
00:59:17,570 --> 00:59:21,470
Daily versus weekly,
percentage changes log changes.

1334
00:59:21,470 --> 00:59:23,130
Units.

1335
00:59:23,130 --> 00:59:27,290
Just like dollar/yen,
interest rates.

1336
00:59:27,290 --> 00:59:30,080
Am I long or am I short?

1337
00:59:30,080 --> 00:59:32,490
If I'm long gold, I show
