1464
01:05:29,450 --> 01:05:36,040
I usually trust my random number
generators in Excel, in MATLAB.

1465
01:05:36,040 --> 01:05:38,980
So I kind of violate my
own rules, I don't check.

1466
01:05:38,980 --> 01:05:43,940
But I think most of your
standard random number

1467
01:05:43,940 --> 01:05:46,074
of generators are
decent enough now.

1468
01:05:46,074 --> 01:05:47,490
And you can go
